# Mini SOC Lab – Splunk SIEM with Splunk SOAR Integration

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates the implementation of a Security Operations Center (SOC) lab using Splunk Enterprise and Linux-based log sources on Microsoft Azure.

The objective is to build a centralized security monitoring environment that collects Linux authentication logs, detects suspicious login activity, generates security alerts, and integrates with Splunk SOAR for automated incident investigation and response.

**Project Status:** SIEM implementation in progress; SOAR deployment and integration planned.

## Architecture

```text
Linux VM – vmtest
       |
       | Splunk Universal Forwarder
       | TCP 9997
       v
Splunk Enterprise – SOC-SPLUNK-01
       |
       v
